==Larval food plant==
''Dombeya burgessiae'' is known to be a larval host plant of the [[Hesperiidae]] ''[[Eagris sabadius]]'' (Grey, 1832)<ref>[https://www.zimbabweflora.co.zw/cult/species.php?species_id=167150 Flora of Zimbabwe]</ref>  and ''[[Abantis pillaana]]'' (Wallengren, 1857).


